    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Located in 6th of October City, Egypt, this food manufacturing factory produces and packages a variety of food products. The facility decaffeinates, roasts, blends, and packages coffee beans. It also produces canned baked goods, as well as canned and frozen pasta products.</p>\r\n",
